---
const questions = [
  ['What does Ribbon need?', 'An Apple silicon Mac running macOS 15 or later, and Accessibility access so Ribbon can focus and arrange your windows.'],
  ['Does it work with my agent apps?', 'Ribbon arranges normal app windows, including agent apps, editors, terminals, and design tools. It does not connect to agent sessions or run tasks. Apps join automatically; Excluded Apps lets you leave particular apps alone. Ribbon and System Settings are protected.'],
  ['Can I pause it?', 'Yes. Pause window management from the menu bar or General settings.'],
  ['Can I use two displays?', 'Each display has its own scrolling workspace. Multi-display pairing is still being tested in the beta.'],
];
---
<section id="questions" class="questions-section"><div class="container questions-layout"><h2>Questions?</h2><div class="question-list">{questions.map(([question, answer]) => <details class="question"><summary>{question}<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>{answer}</p></div></details>)}</div></div></section>
